do it.

1090
00:35:22.440 --> 00:35:28.220
In my early acting struggles and trying to land a role, I was going out for three camera

1091
00:35:28.220 --> 00:35:29.620
because that's what...

1092
00:35:29.620 --> 00:35:30.080
That's what you did.

1093
00:35:30.220 --> 00:35:32.820
That's what the majority of shows were.

1094
00:35:33.080 --> 00:35:34.600
And I was terrible.

1095
00:35:34.940 --> 00:35:35.880
I was terrible.

1096
00:35:36.260 --> 00:35:36.820
I couldn't do it.

1097
00:35:36.880 --> 00:35:40.180
And I didn't understand because I was like, it's in front of a live audience.

1098
00:35:40.380 --> 00:35:41.840
I went to theater school.

1099
00:35:42.060 --> 00:35:43.420
It's just theater, right?

1100
00:35:43.420 --> 00:35:45.160
But it's not just theater.

1101
00:35:45.320 --> 00:35:46.840
No, it's its own art form.

1102
00:35:47.180 --> 00:35:48.920
It's a certain kind of style.

1103
00:35:49.160 --> 00:35:49.340
Yeah.

1104
00:35:49.640 --> 00:35:49.740
Yeah.

1105
00:35:49.740 --> 00:35:50.740
And it is to be respected.

1106
00:35:50.740 --> 00:35:51.020
Yeah.

1107
00:35:51.140 --> 00:35:52.440
And you can do it, Angela.

1108
00:35:52.660 --> 00:35:53.700
Not great, lady.

1109
00:35:53.840 --> 00:35:54.780
No, you can.

1110
00:35:54.940 --> 00:35:55.860
Much better than me.

1111
00:35:55.860 --> 00:35:59.660
I mean, right after the office wrapped, my agents were like, let's get you on a three

1112
00:35:59.660 --> 00:36:00.000
camera.

1113
