And I've told you this with Betty White.

1116
00:36:06.940 --> 00:36:07.280
My gosh.

1117
00:36:07.340 --> 00:36:07.560
Yes.

1118
00:36:07.620 --> 00:36:08.160
Of course.

1119
00:36:08.400 --> 00:36:10.820
I had to be the bitchy principal.

