00:40:02.120 --> 00:40:04.180
The comedy does actually tend itself towards Dwight.

1211
00:40:04.300 --> 00:40:04.680
It does.

1212
00:40:04.900 --> 00:40:05.760
You'd be Jim.

1213
00:40:05.900 --> 00:40:06.100
Yeah.

1214
00:40:07.020 --> 00:40:08.480
I'd be Dwight, and you'd be Pam.

1215
00:40:08.600 --> 00:40:09.360
I'd want to be Pam.

1216
00:40:09.500 --> 00:40:11.120
Yeah, I would have to agree with that assessment.

1217
00:40:11.340 --> 00:40:11.540
Yeah.

1218
00:40:12.080 --> 00:40:13.980
I would have to agree with that assessment entirely.

1219
00:40:14.220 --> 00:40:18.180
Now, I really, really wish we had brought a Jim-Pam-Dwight scene with us.

1220
00:40:18.420 --> 00:40:20.280
We should do that next time.

1221
00:40:20.280 --> 00:40:21.120
Which scene would you like?

1222
00:40:24.260 --> 00:40:25.240
Which scene would you like?

1223
00:40:25.940 --> 00:40:29.360
No, I mean, that's definitely how I would have cast it, too,

1224
00:40:29.460 --> 00:40:31.340
if it had to be the three of us to do it.

1225
00:40:31.340 --> 00:40:32.380
It would have been that.

1226
00:40:32.660 --> 00:40:33.060
So great.

1227
00:40:33.240 --> 00:40:36.380
Is it true that there was a chance you guys were going to be canceled after the first six?

1228
00:40:36.620 --> 00:40:37.240
Oh, yeah.

1229
00:40:37.440 --> 00:40:38.940
Not just after the first six.

1230
00:40:39.100 --> 00:40:42.740
The first six episodes, any day when we went, we were like, oh, we're still here.

1231
00:40:42.860 --> 00:40:43.040
Yay.

1232
00:40:43.240 --> 00:40:43.820
It's crazy.

1233
