When they're doing the big beans going all the way around.

1421
00:47:06.940 --> 00:47:08.120
What does a bean mean?

1422
00:47:08.260 --> 00:47:09.720
Someone tell Kevin what a bean means.

1423
00:47:09.920 --> 00:47:10.200
Yeah.

1424
00:47:10.680 --> 00:47:12.220
And Greg didn't want me to change it.

1425
00:47:12.360 --> 00:47:13.420
He really loved it.

1426
00:47:13.580 --> 00:47:15.680
Like he, I somehow wore him down.

1427
