Well, Mindy had already worn him down.

1428
00:47:17.860 --> 00:47:18.640
Well, this is true.

1429
00:47:18.900 --> 00:47:20.000
Because Kelly's transformation.

1430
00:47:20.340 --> 00:47:20.500
Yeah.

1431
00:47:20.760 --> 00:47:23.160
So by the time you wanted it, he was like, all right.

1432
00:47:23.240 --> 00:47:24.080
He was like, whatever.

1433
