Don't you think, though, if you're being honest, I was just honest about Pam's hair.

1468
00:48:38.220 --> 00:48:41.620
If you're being honest, and I want you all to weigh in.

1469
00:48:41.820 --> 00:48:45.800
Don't you think the character of Angela Martin would wear pantyhose?

1470
00:48:45.980 --> 00:48:46.400
Yeah.

1471
